"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Can be used to output a 'Huuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuge.:tm: explosion, with a large range. Any dynamite sticks which blow up other explosives will have a chain reaction, and explosives can be used to chop trees or break ores.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Dynamite Stick x37</b> has a very powerful explosion, and a very large radius. Like any other explosive, it damages trees and ores.\n</p><p>Unlike bombs, dynamite blows up almost instantly in a chain reaction.\n</p><p>The Dynamite Stick x37 can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\"><big>Location</big></span></h2><p>\nThe explosive is hidden in the rafters of <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 351px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/X37_dynamite_sitcks_location.png/revision/latest?cb=20250930224254\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"sun rails location\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/X37_dynamite_sitcks_location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/351?cb=20250930224254\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"351\" height=\"168\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"X37 dynamite sitcks location.png\" data-image-key=\"X37_dynamite_sitcks_location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:X37_dynamite_sitcks_location.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-